// The architecture: one component per Go or TS package, each naming the
// parts of the spec's system it realizes.
include = [
  "./runtime/",
  "./tools/",
]

| How Heron is built: [unit](#delivery.units) 1's [runtime](#architecture.runtime) and [unit](#delivery.units) 2's
| [development tools](#architecture.tools). Each Go or TS package is one component, which names the
| [parts of the system](#heron.system) it realizes, what it owns, its interface, what it may import, its
| invariants, its errors and the tests that hold it to its contract.
